    <div id="idn-body" >
        
            <h1>Repository of IDN Practices</h1>
            <p>We maintain a collection of &ldquo;IDN tables&rdquo;, which represent permitted code points (letters)
                allowed for
                Internationalised Domain Name registrations in particular registries. To learn about the policy and
                procedures for this repository, including the process to lodge an IDN table, read the
                <a href="/help/idn-repository-procedure">IDN Repository Procedures</a>.</p>
        

        <div class="table-search-panel">
